 <h3><u>Haider hu mai haider</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya ali maula, maula ya ali maula..(2)<br> haider haider haider haider</p> 
  <p>Haider hu mai haider..(2)<br> Kehte the ali kufe&nbsp; me ye barsare mimbar<br> Haider hu mai haider..(2)</p> 
  <p>Hairan hai duniya kyu mere mojize sunkar<br> Haider hu mai haider..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Suraj mere kehne pe bhala kyu na palat ta<br> taara meri dehleez pe kaise na utarta<br> maine hi jalae..(2) the bujha deta mai yaksar<br> Haider hu mai haider..(4)</p> 
  <p>2. Mai ghaib hu duniya ko ye idraak nahi hai<br> haan mujhpe kisi naam ka iflaak nahi hai<br> bus mujhko samajhte..<br> bus mujhko samajh sakte hai allah, payambar<br> Haider hu mai haider..(4)</p> 
  <p>3. Hai rabb ki sadaqat ke hawale mere basme<br> qur'aan me allah ne khai mere qasme<br> 'La Raib' laqab hai..(2) mera qur'aan ke andar<br> Haider hu mai haider..(4)</p> 
  <p>4. Is baat ki qudrat hai faqat mere qalam me<br> tasweer banata hu mai madar ke shikam me<br> takhleeq pe khaliq..(2) ne kiya mujhko muqarrar<br> Haider hu mai haider..(4)</p> 
  <p>5. Gar qatl kiya jau to mai qatl na hunga<br> so(100) baar bhi maut aegi hargiz na marunga<br> bebas hai mere saamne..(2) ye maut ka chakkar<br> Haider hu mai haider..(4)</p> 
  <p>6. Pohche sare meraj nabi jis ghadi logo<br> bas haath milaane ka waha izn tha mujhko<br> jee kar ta tha kehdu..(2) mai ye parde se nikalkar<br> Haider hu mai haider..(4)</p> 
  <p>7. Maa ne kabhi marhab ki ye marhab se kaha tha<br> tu laakh bahadur hai magar usse na ladna<br> maidan me aajae..(2) agar koi ye kehkar<br> Haider hu mai haider..(4)</p> 
  <p>8. Tum kisko darate ho yu naam apne batake<br> wo aur the maidan se jo bhaag gae the<br> mai aam sahabi..(2) nahi ae marhab o antar<br> Haider hu mai haider..(2)</p> 
  <p>9. Jo log samajhte hai mai wallah nahi hu<br> bus jaanlo sab kuch hu mai allah nahi hu<br> mabood hai akbar..(2) wo mera khaliq e akbar<br> Haider hu mai haider..(4)</p> 
  <p>Ya ali maula, maula ya ali maula..(3)</p> 
